183
00:13:00,580 --> 00:13:01,410
What?

184
00:13:01,493 --> 00:13:02,680
It hit the cactus!

185
00:13:03,820 --> 00:13:04,650
Shinobu!

186
00:13:11,880 --> 00:13:13,980
This doesn't make any sense.

187
00:13:14,880 --> 00:13:17,677
Ushikaga Kira just feel a
sense of relief for this

188
00:13:17,760 --> 00:13:20,537
woman because the cactus
needles missed her eyes?

189
00:13:20,620 --> 00:13:22,080
What is this feeling?

190
00:13:23,480 --> 00:13:26,880
Could I actually be
worried about someone else?

191
00:13:27,140 --> 00:13:28,258
What am I thinking?

192
00:13:28,620 --> 00:13:31,157
My only concern is what
might happen if this woman

193
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:34,122
dies and Jotaro Cujoh
discovers I'm at this house.

194
00:13:34,860 --> 00:13:38,331
That's the only reason I'm
relieved to see that she's safe.

195
00:13:39,380 --> 00:13:41,140
That's all there is to it.

196
00:13:42,580 --> 00:13:45,460
Your air attack is now powerless.

197
00:13:47,220 --> 00:13:51,320
Your projectiles might be invisible,
but I know how your tricks work.

198
00:13:51,520 --> 00:13:53,657
You simply compress air and launch it at

199
00:13:53,740 --> 00:13:56,197
your opponent in a
scattering of projectiles.

200
00:13:56,280 --> 00:13:59,398
Now Deadly Queen knows how
to get around your attack.

201
00:14:07,140 --> 00:14:07,970
What?

202
00:14:08,660 --> 00:14:12,977
The little shit he
injected an air bubble into

203
00:14:13,060 --> 00:14:17,560
my vein it's traveling
deeper into my body.

204
00:14:18,680 --> 00:14:22,277
I'm not exactly a medical
expert but injecting

205
00:14:22,360 --> 00:14:24,897
more than 10 cc's of any gas into a vein

206
