Damn, I can't get it out.

209
00:14:36,940 --> 00:14:38,260
There's no other way.

210
00:14:38,460 --> 00:14:40,660
I have to do it! Deadly Queen!

211
00:14:48,500 --> 00:14:50,900
I underestimated that wretched weed.

212
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:54,300
