213
00:14:54,540 --> 00:14:56,780
It's more formidable than I imagined.

214
00:14:57,220 --> 00:14:58,200
What do I do?

215
00:14:59,820 --> 00:15:00,650
All right.

216
00:15:00,733 --> 00:15:02,540
