218
00:15:23,680 --> 00:15:25,800
That was far too close.

219
00:15:26,240 --> 00:15:28,740
I suppose I'll let it slide for now.

220
00:15:29,480 --> 00:15:31,740
Its execution has been stayed.

221
00:15:40,320 --> 00:15:44,438
Kosaku told me that he buried that
poor kitty far away from the house.

222
00:15:44,700 --> 00:15:47,040
When I told him about the cat's curse,

223
00:15:47,260 --> 00:15:50,837
he said it was just a figment of
my imagination brought on by fear,

224
00:15:50,920 --> 00:15:52,637
and that I should get some rest.

225
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:54,040
I can't believe it.

226
00:15:54,300 --> 00:15:56,157
I fainted right in front of him.

227
00:15:56,240 --> 00:15:57,380
How embarrassing!

228
00:15:58,360 --> 00:16:01,497
But he was nice enough to
stay home and look after me,

229
00:16:01,580 --> 00:16:03,417
even though it made him late for work.

230
00:16:03,500 --> 00:16:04,900
It was like a dream.

231
00:16:05,260 --> 00:16:08,436
It felt like he understood
me for the first time ever.

232
00:16:08,860 --> 00:16:12,080
This has been the most
blissful morning of my life.

233
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:23,200
Well, are you enjoying it?

234
00:16:26,600 --> 00:16:27,760
Really, Hayato?

235
00:16:27,980 --> 00:16:30,777
I can't believe that boy left
home without saying goodbye again.

236
00:16:30,860 --> 00:16:32,277
That little brat!

237
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:34,220
Has he been watching me?

238
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:35,440
Oh no, sweetie?

239
00:16:36,160 --> 00:16:37,737
You're eating from my plate!

240
00:16:37,820 --> 00:16:40,397
I know how you hate shiitake mushrooms.

241
00:16:40,480 --> 00:16:41,497
So I took them out.

242
00:16:41,580 --> 00:16:44,345
